hift\nTasks: configure, test, audit\nPersona: architect, sre, devops\nWorkload: resilience\n*","skill_name":"aws-resilience-lifecycle"},{"rank_order":3,"title":"aws-observability","skill_description":"Investigates root causes on the Omni context graph (service dependencies) and Intelligence insights; builds, configures, debugs, tunes AWS observability - operator-symptom questions, detecting Omni vs classic CloudWatch. CloudWatch on a reporting service: fleet health views, Log Insights, metric/composite/anomaly alarms, custom metrics/EMF, dashboards, X-Ray/ADOT tracing, canaries, CloudTrail, Dynamic Instrumentation (live breakpoints), and Application Signals service map. CloudWatch Omni on an existing Space: SQL over logs/traces, PromQL, Omni dashboards, alerts and Slack notifications, programmatic/IaC access (API/SDK/CLI/CFN), driving Omni from a coding agent or skills, AI agent quality from traces - on-demand and online evaluation of live traffic, incl. setting it up, readback, evaluators. For first-time setup - creating an Omni Space, granting access, ingestion, or ADOT instrumentation for Application Signals or Omni - use setting-up-cloudwatch-observability. Not for app logging or threat detection.\n\nServices: cloudwatch, cloudwatch-omni, xray, cloudtrail, synthetics, application-signals\nTasks: build, deploy, debug, optimize, configure, enable, onboard, instrument, query\nPersona: developer, devops\nWorkload: observability\n*","skill_name":"aws-observability"}]}}"}]}], "label": "Search AWS docs for sustainability pillar SUS04 Data best practices count"}

